New solution to correctly address ACW-9 Change in Insured Name


Description

A new solution is required to correctly handle ACW- 9 (Change in Insured Name) in eZDocs.

The previous implementation caused compatibility issues with manually coded renewals. A permanent solution is needed that supports both manually entered renewals and uploaded program entries. 

Acceptance Criteria:

Insured name changes are correctly reflected in eZDocs.

Renewals link correctly to the updated insured name.

Solution works for both manually coded and uploaded program entries. 

No impact to existing active policies. 

Solution is validated in lower environment before production deployment. 
